Opaque derived image set — NOTICE and provenance
=================================================

This directory is NOT vendored material. It is a DERIVED set: the seven pool
cases of `../act-image/` with every asset path rewritten, generated by
`clearway/eval/image_opaque.py` and regenerable from that directory alone.

It is kept separate from `act-image/` precisely because that set's promise is
that ACT's expert-authored bytes are untouched, and this set's whole purpose is
to change them.

